            "description": "Every KPI, chart series and panel on the overview screen, computed server-side in a single database round-trip:\n\n- `kpis` — portfolio valuation, cost basis, unrealised gain, position counts, filings due soon\n- `cashflow` — trailing 12 months, grouped by month, VOID excluded, zero-filled\n- `valuationByAssetType` — grouped by the underlying asset's type\n- `distributions` — paid against pending\n- `committedVsDeployed` — and the uncalled remainder\n- `recentTransactions`, `upcomingFilings`"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('unrealised gain is valuation less cost basis', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.kpis.unrealisedGain).to.be.closeTo(",
                  "    body.kpis.portfolioValuation - body.kpis.costBasis,",
